{"ID":"20240205165633-tlm6vpo","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205165633-tlm6vpo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165633-tlm6vpo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095544-q27xuyt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617101521-l50zxtw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620143041-8bzyicw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:11,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:11\u0026#125;","title":"096枸杞（枸杞子\u0026amp;地骨皮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240710185703"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240710182821-jj6a20s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710182821-jj6a20s","updated":"20240710183325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"枸杞子"}]},{"ID":"20240206095544-q27xuyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095544-q27xuyt","updated":"20240206095552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于甘肃、宁夏、新疆、内蒙古、青海等地。\n【性状】\t呈类纺锤形或椭圆形，表面红色或暗红色，项端有小突起状的花柱痕，基部有白色的果梗痕。果皮柔韧，皱缩；果肉肉质，柔润。种子20"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"50粒，类肾形。扁而翘，表面浅黄色或棕黄色。气微，味甜。\n【性味】\t甘，平。\n【功效】\t滋补肝肾，益精明目。"}]},{"ID":"20240206095545-vcmicgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095545-vcmicgo","updated":"20240206095545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095545-chnwjfw.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165806-wb4abbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165806-wb4abbn","updated":"20240205165806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"枸杞子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/枸杞子-20240205165806-w2vxd93.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710182830-1ysanuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710182830-1ysanuz","updated":"20240710182830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"地骨皮（枸杞根）"}]},{"ID":"20240710182838-xhe3bdl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710182838-xhe3bdl","updated":"20240710182838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产宁夏、甘肃、河南、河北等地。\n【性状】\t干燥根皮为短小的筒状或槽状卷片，大小不一，一般长310cm，宽0.61.5cm，厚约3mm。外表面灰黄色或棕黄色，粗糙，有错杂的纵裂纹，易剥落。内表面黄白色，较平坦，有细纵纹。质轻脆，易折断，断面不平坦，外层棕黄色，内层灰白色。臭微。味微甘。\n【性味】\t甘，寒。\n【功效】\t凉血除蒸，清肺降火。用于阴虚潮热、骨蒸盗汗、肺热咳嗽、咯血、衄血。"}]},{"ID":"20240710182838-2bfjez8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710182838-2bfjez8","updated":"20240710182838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135018-6kds7c1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710182838-4j6rixp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710182838-4j6rixp","updated":"20240710182838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地骨皮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地骨皮-20240205155549-i1zm20v.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710182922-9ixhlok","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240710182922-9ixhlok"}},{"ID":"20240221193123-w5ala7w",